docs/sync/

# CHART-7 — the pre-change render frozen by scripts/chart-7-ground-probe.tsx.
# Untracked on purpose: it is a build artifact of the BASE commit, regenerated by
# the recipe in the probe's docblock, and it is a megabyte of markup and CSS.
# ⚠ Deliberately NOT under `.next/`, which `pnpm build` cleans — it was there
# once, and the rebuild taken to measure the after-state destroyed it.
.chart7-before/
